From: Mate Molnar <matemolnar88@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 11:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] simple: Add MediaTek MT8167 camsv (Lenovo Tab E7) with swISP

The mt8167-camsv driver captures RAW Bayer straight from the SENINF/ISP
pass1 path, no hardware ISP: use the software ISP.

---
--- a/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
+++ b/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
@@ -261,6 +261,7 @@
 	{ "intel-ipu6", {}, true },
 	{ "intel-ipu7", {}, true },
 	{ "j721e-csi2rx", {}, true },
+	{ "mt8167-camsv", {}, true },
 	{ "mtk-seninf", { { "mtk-mdp", 3 } }, false },
 	{ "mxc-isi", {}, false },
 	{ "qcom-camss", {}, true },
